@startuml Sequence_S1_01_Browse_Catalog
' US-S1-01 : Consulter le catalogue (filtre catégorie dans l'URL)

title US-S1-01 — Parcourir le catalogue produits

actor "Client / Visiteur\n(Angular)" as UI
participant "ProductsController\nGET /api/products" as ProdCtrl
participant "CategoriesController\nGET /api/categories" as CatCtrl
participant "ProductService" as ProdSvc
participant "CategoryService" as CatSvc
database "PostgreSQL\n(EF Core)" as DB

== Chargement page catalogue ==

UI -> CatCtrl : GET /api/categories
activate CatCtrl
CatCtrl -> CatSvc : GetAllAsync()
CatSvc -> DB : SELECT Categories
CatSvc --> CatCtrl : CategoryDTO[]
CatCtrl --> UI : 200
deactivate CatCtrl

UI -> UI : Lit query params URL\n(?categoryId=, ?q=)

UI -> ProdCtrl : GET /api/products?categoryId={id}
activate ProdCtrl
ProdCtrl -> ProdSvc : GetAllProductsAsync(categoryId)
ProdSvc -> DB : SELECT Products\n(+ Category si jointure)
ProdSvc --> ProdCtrl : ProductDTO[]
ProdCtrl --> UI : 200 liste produits
deactivate ProdCtrl

opt Détail produit
  UI -> ProdCtrl : GET /api/products/{id}
  activate ProdCtrl
  ProdCtrl -> ProdSvc : GetProductByIdAsync(id)
  ProdSvc -> DB : SELECT Product
  alt introuvable
    ProdSvc --> ProdCtrl : null
    ProdCtrl --> UI : 404
  else trouvé
    ProdSvc --> ProdCtrl : ProductDTO
    ProdCtrl --> UI : 200
  end
  deactivate ProdCtrl
end

note over UI
  Filtres synchronisés avec l'URL Angular
  (categoryId, recherche locale).
  Route publique — pas de JWT requis.
end note

@enduml
